  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive verb ({他動詞|たどうし}). Pattern: AをBに{嗾|けしか}ける (to sic A on B) or Aを{嗾|けしか}けて〜させる (to incite A to do ~)\n\nWRITING:\n{嗾|けしか}ける is often written in hiragana as けしかける because the kanji {嗾|けしか} is uncommon.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {嗾|けしか}ける - to incite, egg on (often negative connotation)\n- {焚|た}き{付|つ}ける - to stir up, incite\n- {煽|あお}る - to fan, provoke\n- そそのかす - to tempt, entice",
